/public/word-illustrations/senior/invoke-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-judicial-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"judicial","sort_order":1,"sense":"司法的","alt_zh":"高中生跟著導覽員走進莊嚴法庭，觀察法官席與證人席。","example":"The students visited a judicial building to learn how courts work.","example_zh":"學生參訪司法大樓，了解法院如何運作。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/judicial-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-latent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"latent","sort_order":1,"sense":"潛在的","alt_zh":"高中女生驚喜地展示第一次捏出的精緻陶鳥，老師讚賞地點頭。","example":"The art teacher noticed Mei's latent talent when she shaped her first clay bird.","example_zh":"美第一次捏出陶鳥時，美術老師就發現她潛在的天分。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/latent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-lethal-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"lethal","sort_order":1,"sense":"致命的","alt_zh":"巡山員伸手示意高中生別碰野生蘑菇，讓大家保持安全距離。","example":"The ranger warned that this mushroom contains a lethal poison.","example_zh":"巡山員警告，這種蘑菇含有致命毒素。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lethal-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-leverage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"leverage","sort_order":1,"sense":"槓桿","alt_zh":"老師指導高中生用長木棒支在小石頭上，把較大的石塊翹起。","example":"The long handle gave us enough leverage to lift the heavy stone.","example_zh":"長柄提供足夠的槓桿作用，讓我們抬起重石。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/leverage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-liable-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"liable","sort_order":1,"sense":"有責任的","alt_zh":"高中生小心把借來的相機放入保護袋，老師指著安全使用示意圖。","example":"Anyone who borrows a camera is liable for damage caused by careless handling.","example_zh":"借相機的人必須為粗心操作造成的損壞負責。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/liable-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-logistics-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"logistics","sort_order":1,"sense":"後勤","alt_zh":"志工在桌上的無字路線模型上安排貨車與食品箱的運送。","example":"The volunteers planned the logistics of moving food to the shelter.","example_zh":"志工規劃把食物運送到收容所的後勤工作。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/logistics-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-lucrative-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"lucrative","sort_order":1,"sense":"有利可圖的","alt_zh":"高中生手作陶碗攤位前客人排隊，收款罐裡累積許多硬幣。","example":"Selling handmade bowls became a lucrative activity for the school craft fair.","example_zh":"販售手工陶碗成為校園手作市集裡獲利豐厚的活動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/lucrative-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-malfunction-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"malfunction","sort_order":1,"sense":"故障","alt_zh":"高中生在安全關閉電源後，發現模型火車旁鬆脫的電線。","example":"A loose wire caused the model train to malfunction.","example_zh":"鬆脫的電線使模型火車故障。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/malfunction-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mandate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mandate","sort_order":1,"sense":"命令；規定","alt_zh":"老師在校園騎車活動起點逐一確認高中生戴好安全帽。","example":"The school's safety mandate requires a helmet during cycling activities.","example_zh":"學校的安全規定要求騎車活動時戴安全帽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mandate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1",